# Windows shell files are checked out with CRLF — cmd.exe is unhappy with
# LF-only batch files around labels and parenthesised blocks, and the installer
# kit ships these files to a Windows PC verbatim — while the repository itself
# keeps LF, so diffs and the PowerShell linter stay sane.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
